  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Once a notorious street racer known as \"Nitro,\" this duck's body was ravaged by a DRIP-fueled explosion during a high-stakes race in Sector 7. Now, he's rebuilt himself, fueled by vengeance and the thrill of the underground Drip circuit. They say he's part machine now, scavenging parts from anywhere he can find them.",
    "class": "Mechanized Scavenger",
    "name": "Wrench Rot",
    "personality": "Gritty and cynical, Wrench Rot trusts no one, his drawl often ending with dark humor. He is resourceful, fixing or building anything with what he can find, and driven to find every last drop of DRIP due to his need to continually upgrade his body. He's also secretly sentimental, protecting those who can't protect themselves in old Subchain City.",
